    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Beni-hadadi na nzengo gwa Samalia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makanza malebe ntemi Beni-hadadi wa Alamu ūbabilinga pye a bashilikale bakwe, hūna ūja kūgūdumīla ū nzengo gwa Samalia. Ūja hamò na batemi bangī makūmi adatū na babīlī, na falasa jabo na magogoteni gabo ga būlūgū; būūkatūūla ng'hambī ja kūgūpīndīlīja ū nzengo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūtūma nhūng'wa ū mu nzengo, ū kūlī Ahabu ū ntemi wa Isilaeli; kūhaya, “Ū ntemi Beni-hadadi alīhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ī feza nī zahabu ījo ūlī najo jilī jane; na a bake bako a basoga basoga bane, pye na a baana bako!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūhaya, “Ūmo ūlīhayīla dūhū baba ntemi gūlī chene; ū nene nī shikolo īsho nalī nasho tūlī bako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūng'wa būshoka hangī; benha yīngī balīhaya, “Ū ntemi Beni-hadadi alīhaya gīkī, ‘Naamalile kwenha mhola kūkūwīla gīkī, ī feza nī zahabu ījo ūlī najo jilī jane, pye na a bake bako na a baana bako.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo lūūlū ī ntondo makanza gītī genaya nakūtūma koi batūmami bane, bize balolalole pye a hose ū mu numba y'ikūlū lyako, nī numba ja bataale ba mu sī yako; būlī shikolo īsho balabone gīkī shilī shawiza bakūshisola banenhele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūbitana pye a banamhala ba mu sī yakwe, ūbawīla; “Mulībūbona ū wikoloosha bo munhū ng'wenūyū ūmo būlī, walī wenhile nhūng'wa kūhaya gīkī a bake bane na a baana bane, nī feza nī zahabu ījo nalī najo jilī jakwe; natanemegije.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banamhala ba banhū bakwe būng'wīla, “Lemaga nīyo yaya nū kūndegeleka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūbashokeja a batūng'wa ba ng'wa Beni-hadadi; ūbawīla, “Ng'wīlagi ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi gīkī, ‘Ū ntūmami wako akwīshikīlīja pyī īyo walī wīhayile a ha wandījo, alīyo ūyo wagūhaya haha natūgūdūla ū gwene.’” Abo baalī baatūng'wa bīnga, būtwala ī lishosho ū kūlī Beni-hadadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Beni-hadadi ūtūma nhūng'wa hangī ū kūlī Ahabu kūhaya, “A bamulungu ni banitūlage hataale na kūtinda ho, ūlū lūlasaage lūbuubu nūūlū lūgehu ū mu Samalia, kūlwa kūbagabanhya a banhū bane būlī ng'wene apandīke nūūlū twa ngota!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūbashokeja alīhaya, “Ng'wīlagi gīkī, ‘Ū munhū ūlū alī ng'wikanza lya kūzwalīla shilanga shakwe,’ atizigīmbagīmba gīt'ūyo wamala kūshizuula haha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Beni-hadadi aho alīwīlwa ū mhayo gwenūyo walī nabo a batemi biye bang'waga walwa mu maheema gabo. Hūna ūbawīla a banhū bakwe, “Īmagi hīgīyī lyashika ī likanza lya kūgūtūla ū nzengo.” Ng'hana bīma hīgīyī, gīkī bandye kūgūtūla ū nzengo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu kūmpyena Beni-hadadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo wiza ng'hangi ū kūlī ntemi wa Isilaeli ū Ahabu; ūhaya, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ūlīlībona ī libità ī litaale lyenīlī? Ī lelo yenīyī nakūlītūūla mu nkono gwako, a henaho h'ūkūdeeba gīkī, ū nene nalī SEEBA.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahabu ūbūūja, “Nani akūgwīta ū mhayo gwenūyū?” Ū ng'hangi ūhaya, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gkī, ‘Gūkwītwa na basūmba, a bagunanhi ba basugi ba mapandī ayo galīmo ū mu sī yako.’” Ūbūūja hangī, “Al'ū wa kūwandya ū būlūgū nani?” Ū ng'hangi ūhaya, “Ūkūbiza bebe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Ahabu ūbitana a basūmba, a bagunanhi ba basugi ba mu sī yakwe; baalī magana abīlī na makūmi adatū na babīlī. Hanuma ya henaho ūbabilinga na a Baisilaeli a bangī, a bose būbiza banhū shihūmbī mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būfuma ū mu nzengo makanza ga līīmi, ū Beni-hadadi na a batemi abo makūmi adatū na babīlī, baalī mu maheema gabo bakūng'waga walwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A basūmba, a bagunanhi ba basugi ba mu sī, hū būtonga ū kūfuma. Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Beni-hadadi walī wamala kūtūūla balang'hani ba kūyūlola batizisanganījiwa; na lūūlū būng'wīla, “Balīho banhū balīfumīīla Samalia!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūshosha ūhaya, “Badimagi mubenhe balī bapanga gīko; babize baliza mu mhola, nūūlū baliza kū būlūgū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A basūmba, a bagunanhi ba basugi ba mu sī aho balīfuma ū mu nzengo, ū kū numa yabo lyakūūbījaga ī libità lya bashilikale; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "būshikīla kwandya kūbatūla a banishi, būlī munhū wamūlaga ng'wilwisha wakwe. Aho yaja gīko a Baalamu būpeela nhambo; nabo a Baisilaeli būboolomya. Gwike ū ntemi Beni-hadadi ū wa Alamu, ūdamhīla falasa ūpeela, ūbiza wapūlūgūka, na banhū bakwe balebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūbaheeba kībi no, nūūlū īkī baalī na falasa na a magogoteni; akababūlaga Baalamu bingī no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya makanza, ū ng'hangi wiza hangī ū kūlī ntemi wa Isilaeli ūng'wīla, “Ideedeeng'hanyage wīlole chiza īyo yigelile kūbeejiwa, ūlīguzuhyī ī libità lyako. Nguno a ha ng'waka ū mu matūja malaale akwiza hangī kūkūdumīla ū ntemi wa Alamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Beni-hadadi kūpyenwa hangī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Alamu nang'hwe ū kwenūko, a banhū bakwe bandya kūnganikīla kahelele kapya ka mihayo balīng'wīla, “A benabo baatūpyenile kūlwa nguno a bamulungu babo balī bamulungu ba mu sī ja magūlya, alīyo ūlū tūūlwa nabo tūlī mu mbūga, tūkūbaheeba dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū gwa kwīta gūūyū, bīnjage pye a batemi a ha masumbī gabo, booye ū kūfunya ī shilagīlo, ūtūūle bangī a ha ng'wanya gwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nīyo ī libità īlo wajimīīgije ūlīshoshe gīt'ūmo lyalī; ībize falasa kū falasa, n'igogogteni kūlw'igogoteni; hama tūje kū mbūga, h'ūko tūkalwīle nabo a Baisilaeli; tambala machimu tūkūbaheeba.” Ū Beni-hadadi wizunīlīja nabo, wīta gīt'ūmo bakang'wīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'waka ūyo gūkakūūbīja, ū Beni-hadadi ūbabilinga hangī a Balaamu ū mu shikū ja matūja mbelele, ūja Afeki kūjūlwa būlūgū na a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli nabo bikobya; aho banukūla ī shilanga būbūūka bajile koi ū kwilwisha būlūgū nabo. A Baisilaeli būtūūla ī ng'hambī yabo kū ntambūko, biilola nabo; alīyo būbiza gītī tūdaale tūbīlī twa mbūli, a Baalamu a bene baalī lweelwe ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu wiza hangī ū kūlī ntemi wa Isilaeli ūng'wīla, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Īkī a Baalamu bakwiganikaga gīkī ū SEEBA alī mulungu wa mu sī ja magūlya dūhū, atī mulungu wa mu sī ja ntubīlo, na lūūlū ī libità na būtaale lyenīlī nakūlītūūla mu makono gako, ūmane gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jūbīta shikū mpungatī batūūgije dūhū bikiimaalīlile; a ha lūshikū lwa mpungatī wandya ū būlūgū; a Baisilaeli būbūlaga Baalamu shihūmbī igana līmò ū mu lūshikū lūmò lwenūlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakasaaga būpeelela mu nzengo gwa Afeki; alīyo ī ndugu ya nzengo gwenūyo yūgwa, yūbabbuudya banhū shihūmbī makūmi abīlī na mpungatī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu kūnekeja Beni-hadadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū Beni-hadadi akapeelela ū mu nzengo, ūkingīla mu numba īmò, wibisa mu chumba sha mu gatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma a batūmami bakwe būng'wīla, “Tūkigwaga gīkī a batemi ba numba ya Isilaeli balī na shigongo. Tūzunīlījage tūje ū kūlī ntemi wa Isilaeli, tūzwalile magūnīla mu mikīmbīlī, na twitunge ngoye kū mitwe, hamo akūkūchīla shigongo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana būzwala magūnīla ū mu mikīmbīlī, nū kū mitwe bitunga ngoye, hūna būja ū kūlī ntemi wa Isilaeli; būūkang'wibūūlīla balīhaya, “Ū ntūmami wako ū Beni-hadadi alīkūlomba gīkī, ‘Nalīkwikūmbīlīja ūnikūlīlwe nikale mpanga.’” Ū ntemi ūhaya, “Gashi ataalī alīho mpanga? Ū ng'wenūyo ng'wanong'wise!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo būbonela ho mhayo gwa kūbalūngūja, būgūsabba wangū ū mhayo gwenūyo; būhaya, “Ee ū ng'wanong'wing'we ū Beni-hadadi!” Ū ntemi ūbawīla, “Jagi mukang'wenhe.” Ū Beni-hadadi aho wiza, ū Ahabu ūng'wegeleja ng'wigogoteni lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Beni-hadadi ūhaya, “Nakūkūshokeja ī mizengo īyo walī wīdima baba kūfuma kūlī so, nū mu nzengo gwa Damasiko ūdūgije kūtūūla mo a magūlilū gako, gīt'ūmo so walī wītīla mu Samalia.” Ū Ahabu ūng'wīla, “Nakūkūlekela ūje ūlū tūūlagana ū mu mihayo yenīyī.” Būlagana ng'hana, hūna ūnekela ūja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu kwiyenhela makoye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wizīīla ūmò wa bahangi; ūng'wīla ng'wiye, “Bebe nalīkūlomba ūnitūle nang'ha,” alīyo ū ng'wiye ūlema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'hangi ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla ū ng'wiye, “Īkī walema ū kwīta ūmo gūlīhayīla mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA, ūlū ūlīnge a henaha ūkūbūlagwa shimba.” Ng'hana aho wīnga dūhū a henaho yūmpondya shimba, yūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'hangi ūpandīka munhū ūngī; nang'hwe ūng'wīla, “Ngosha nalīkūlomba ūnitūle nang'ha.” Ū ng'wene ūntūla, ūmmela lūguma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ng'hangi ng'wenūyo ūja kwīmīīla bbihī na nzīla, ūnindīīla ū ntemi kūshisha abīte. Wipalingīja līng'wenda ū kū ntwe lyūbūshīkīja ū būshū kwiza mu miso, yūbiza shilambu ū kūūmana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitulwa washika ū ntemi alībīta; ūnīlīīla alīhaya, “Aho twalī twajile ū kū būlūgū, ū nene ntūmami wako nūkalibīla kū gatī yabo gete. Kwimanīla munhū ūmò wanenhela nding'wa wa mu būlūgū; ūniwīla gīkī, ‘Nang'hanage gete ū ng'wenūyū, ūlū ūjimīīla ū būpanga wako būkūbiza ha ng'wanya gwa būpanga bokwe, ūlū ītī chene ūkūfunya feza kilo makūmi adatū n'inè.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo lūūlū, ū nene ntūmami wako naalī nakwīlīlwa myatīla, naakiluluka ū munhū ng'wenūyo wajaga!” Aho alīkalīcha dūhū ī gīko, ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūpondekeja alīhaya, “Ū nsango gwako ūgūmanile; hū gwenūyo wamalaga kwilamula bebe ng'wenekīlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho na haho ū ng'hangi ng'wenūyo ūkangīlīja kūlyīnja wangū wangū ī līng'wenda ū kū ntwe, īlo lyaalī lyabūshīkīja ū būshū kūshisha mu miso. Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūng'witegeleja gīkī walī ūmò wa bahangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla ū ntemi, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Wanekelaga munhū ūyo naalī naamalile kūhela gīkī ache, na lūūlū ū būpanga wako būkūbiza ha ng'wanya gwa būpanga wakwe, na a banhū bako ha ng'wanya gwa banhū bakwe.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli wīnga hoi wadudubalaga, ūja ī kaya ī Samalia ūūkashika wadakaga na kadakīle kangī nako nīyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
